{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/init(ellipsein:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"init","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4PathV9ellipseInAC0A7Spatial6Rect3DV_tcfc","title":"init(ellipseIn:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ellipseIn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Rect3DV","text":"Rect3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/init(ellipseIn:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a path as an ellipse within the given rectangle."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ellipseIn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rect","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Rect3DV","text":"Rect3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"rect","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rectangle that bounds the ellipse."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a convenience function that creates a path of an ellipse."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Using this convenience function is more efficient than creating a path and adding an ellipse to it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The ellipse is approximated by a sequence of Bézier curves."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Its center is the midpoint of the rectangle defined by the rect parameter."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the rectangle is square, then the ellipse is circular with a radius equal to one-half the width (or height) of the rectangle."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the rect parameter specifies a rectangular shape, then the major and minor axes of the ellipse are defined by the width and height of the rectangle."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The ellipse forms a complete subpath of the path—that is, the ellipse drawing starts with a move-to operation and ends with a close-subpath operation, with all moves oriented in the clockwise direction."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you supply an affine transform, then the constructed Bézier curves that define the ellipse are transformed before they are added to the path."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Path":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Path","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The outline of a 2D shape."}],"title":"Path","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Path","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Path/init(ellipseIn:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/init(ellipseIn:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a path as an ellipse within the given rectangle.","type":"text"}],"title":"init(ellipseIn:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ellipseIn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Rect3DV","text":"Rect3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/init(ellipsein:)"}}}